#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Potret pasuryan sampeyan sing Ubuntu Hello mbandhingake. Tansah paling ora "
"loro, direkam ing cahya sing beda."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Nuduhake model sing disimpen kanggo:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Mung siji model rai sing kadaftar. Kacamata, owah-owahan brengos utawa cahya "
"beda ngowahi carane kamera ndeleng rai sampeyan, dadi model siji bisa gagal "
"(contone wayah sore ing sangisore lampu). Tambahake model kapindho nganggo "
"utawa tanpa kacamata, tampilan sampeyan liyane, utawa ing cahya beda supaya "
"mbukak kunci tetep bisa dipercaya."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Tambah model kapindho"

